    "payloads/00-participant.md": "# Brief\nCreate a local library reservation demonstration. 명세서 input fixture.\n",
    "payloads/01-planning.md": "# Plan\nScope: reserve one available title. Synthetic fixture; estimates unknown.\n",
    "payloads/02-requirements.md": "# Requirements\nREQ-001: Reject a second active reservation for the same copy.\n",
    "payloads/03-design.md": "# Design\nOne transactional reservation service; duplicate reservation returns a conflict.\n",
    "payloads/04-implementation.md": "# Candidate manifest\nFixture only. No executable application supplied by this fixture.\n",
    "payloads/05-testing.md": "# Test report\nNOT RUN. Fixture transport example; no release approval.\n",
    "payloads/06-maintenance.md": "# Maintenance request\nPropose reservation expiry. Requires requirements revision; not implemented.\n"
  },
